---
title: "珠光计划 — Bojoo Online"
layout: null
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{% include "header.njk" %}

<style>
  .zhuguang-page {
    padding: 40px 0 60px;
  }
  .zh-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }
  .zh-header h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .zh-header p {
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
  .zh-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #e3f2fd;
    color: #1565c0;
    padding: 4px 14px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .zh-intro {
    background: var(--color-bg-light);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .zh-intro h2 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .zh-intro p {
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .zh-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  .zh-card {
    background: var(--color-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 24px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .zh-card .zh-icon {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .zh-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .zh-card p {
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .zh-roadmap {
    background: var(--color-bg-light);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 24px;
  }
  .zh-roadmap h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .roadmap-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 12px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .roadmap-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .roadmap-phase {
    min-width: 60px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    padding-top: 2px;
  }
  .roadmap-desc {
    flex: 1;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .roadmap-status {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .rs-plan { background: #e3f2fd; color: #1565c0; }
  .rs-wip { background: #fff3e0; color: #e65100; }
</style>

<section class="zhuguang-page">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="zh-header">
      <h1>✨ 珠光计划</h1>
      <p>品牌达人孵化与运营计划</p>
      <span class="zh-badge">📋 规划中</span>
    </div>

    <div class="zh-intro">
      <h2>计划概述</h2>
      <p>
        珠光计划旨在通过系统化的达人孵化与内容运营策略，
        在小红书、抖音等社交平台建立宝珠奶酪的品牌声量矩阵，
        将好评达人转化为品牌传播节点，形成自增长的口碑飞轮。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="zh-grid">
      <div class="zh-card">
        <div class="zh-icon">🎯</div>
        <h3>达人筛选</h3>
        <p>
          基于现有好评达人库（1480条，Level≥5），
          筛选高影响力达人进行深度合作，
          建立达人等级评估体系。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="zh-card">
        <div class="zh-icon">📝</div>
        <h3>内容赋能</h3>
        <p>
          为达人提供素材包、产品故事、拍摄指南，
          降低内容创作门槛，提升帖子质量和传播效果。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="zh-card">
        <div class="zh-icon">📊</div>
        <h3>效果追踪</h3>
        <p>
          监控达人帖子的曝光量、互动率、到店转化，
          建立 ROI 评估模型，持续优化达人合作策略。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="zh-roadmap">
      <h3>📅 阶段规划</h3>
      <div class="roadmap-item">
        <span class="roadmap-phase">Phase 1</span>
        <span class="roadmap-desc">
          好评达人库盘点与分级，建立 L5~L8 达人档案
        </span>
        <span class="roadmap-status rs-wip">进行中</span>
      </div>
      <div class="roadmap-item">
        <span class="roadmap-phase">Phase 2</span>
        <span class="roadmap-desc">
          小红书使用文档上线，达人协作流程标准化
        </span>
        <span class="roadmap-status rs-plan">规划中</span>
      </div>
      <div class="roadmap-item">
        <span class="roadmap-phase">Phase 3</span>
        <span class="roadmap-desc">
          达人合作激励机制设计（积分/权益/专属福利）
        </span>
        <span class="roadmap-status rs-plan">规划中</span>
      </div>
      <div class="roadmap-item">
        <span class="roadmap-phase">Phase 4</span>
        <span class="roadmap-desc">
          数据看板上线，达人效果实时追踪
        </span>
        <span class="roadmap-status rs-plan">规划中</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "footer.njk" %}
